{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 05 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">自监督学习：对比、聚类、自蒸馏与遮挡重建</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Self-Supervised Learning</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_093_byol-title\">BYOL</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">没有负样本队列或聚类码本，核心稳定器是 stop-gradient、EMA 教师和仅在线侧存在的 predictor。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Negative-free self-supervised representation learning stabilized by an asymmetric online predictor MLP, stop-gradient, and an EMA target encoder.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">同一图像的两种随机增强视图</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Two differently augmented views (v, v') of the same image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">在线 encoder 的增强不变表示</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Augmentation-invariant representation from the online encoder f_θ</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2020/hash/f3ada80d5c4ee70142b17b8192b2958e-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_093_byol')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_093_byol')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"BYOL original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/6f73c01a3f198440a38b.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_093_byol', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_093_byol\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_093_byol')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_093_byol', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_093_byol\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">双增强视图</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">裁剪、颜色扰动、模糊等产生 v1 与 v2</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests two differently augmented views (v, v') of the same image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"裁剪、颜色扰动、模糊等产生 v1 与 v2\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests two differently augmented views (v, v') of the same image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"双增强视图\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_093_byol', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">双增强视图</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">裁剪、颜色扰动、模糊等产生 v1 与 v2</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests two differently augmented views (v, v') of the same image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可训练主干提取当前视图表示\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"在线 encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_093_byol', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">在线 encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可训练主干提取当前视图表示</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把 backbone 表示映射到自监督空间\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projector within the core negative free ema self distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"在线 projector\" data-node-name-en=\"projector\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_093_byol', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">在线 projector</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projector</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把 backbone 表示映射到自监督空间</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projector within the core negative free ema self distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"仅在线分支存在，预测目标分支投影\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs symmetric predictor within the core negative free ema self distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"非对称 predictor\" data-node-name-en=\"symmetric predictor\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_093_byol', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">非对称 predictor</span><span class=\"lang-en\">symmetric predictor</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">仅在线分支存在，预测目标分支投影</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs symmetric predictor within the core negative free ema self distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"参数由在线分支指数滑动平均更新，不接收梯度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs objective encoder + projector within the core negative free ema self distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"目标 encoder + projector\" data-node-name-en=\"objective encoder + projector\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_093_byol', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">目标 encoder + projector</span><span class=\"lang-en\">objective encoder + projector</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">参数由在线分支指数滑动平均更新，不接收梯度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs objective encoder + projector within the core negative free ema self distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"目标表示归一化后作为固定回归靶\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stop-gradient target within the core negative free ema self distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Stop-gradient target\" data-node-name-en=\"Stop-gradient target\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_093_byol', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Stop-gradient target</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">目标表示归一化后作为固定回归靶</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stop-gradient target within the core negative free ema self distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"v1 预测 v2 与 v2 预测 v1 两个方向求和\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies symmetric loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"对称余弦回归损失\" data-node-name-en=\"symmetric loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_093_byol', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">对称余弦回归损失</span><span class=\"lang-en\">symmetric loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">v1 预测 v2 与 v2 预测 v1 两个方向求和</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies symmetric loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"下游只使用在线 encoder\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces augmentation-invariant representation from the online encoder f_θ via Stage 08.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"迁移表示\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 08\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_093_byol', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">迁移表示</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 08</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">下游只使用在线 encoder</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces augmentation-invariant representation from the online encoder f_θ via Stage 08.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"BYOL Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 跨视图回归与 EMA 教师更新</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Asymmetric Cross-View Cosine Regression with EMA Target Network</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"BYOL：核心公式 · 跨视图回归与 EMA 教师更新\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"93\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"14.409525pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.000129 287.137543 14.409525\" width=\"287.137543pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.697191-2.272921V-2.828745H.615376V-2.272921H5.697191Z\" id=\"m093_g7-0\"></path><path d=\"M9.548254-2.272921V-2.828745H1.687321L2.868446-4.258005L2.560758-4.585544L.615376-2.540907L2.560758-.516122L2.868446-.843661L1.687321-2.272921H9.548254Z\" id=\"m093_g7-32\"></path><path d=\"M9.548254-2.560758L7.602872-4.585544L7.295184-4.24808L8.466383-2.828745H1.687321L2.868446-4.258005L2.560758-4.585544L.615376-2.540907L2.560758-.516122L2.868446-.843661L1.687321-2.272921H8.466383L7.295184-.833735L7.60287