 y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"95.39718\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g7-185\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"99.11324\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g20-49\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"106.861893\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g7-36\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"119.83097\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g20-50\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"124.81229\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g7-186\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"128.627966\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g13-150\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"142.950869\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g13-98\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"150.729399\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g7-32\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"163.827986\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g13-103\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"169.008561\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g13-98\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"176.233625\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g7-184\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"185.28186\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g7-185\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"188.997921\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g20-49\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"196.193107\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g7-0\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"204.872719\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g13-103\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"209.953665\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g7-186\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"213.898851\" xlink:href=\"#m093_g13-92\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">对比学习依赖大批量负样本，假负例可能破坏语义</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Contrastive methods were sensitive to negative sample batch sizes and false-negative collisions among clinically similar scans.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在线网络预测目标网络的增强视图表示，目标参数用指数滑动平均更新</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Train an online network (with an extra predictor head) to regress the stop-gradient representation of a momentum-updated target network.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在无显式负样本下，以不对称预测器和 EMA 教师经验上避免坍塌；其机制有多种理论解释</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Eliminates explicit negative pairs entirely while avoiding representation collapse via architectural asymmetry and EMA dynamics.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">适合无标签医学图像预训练和跨增强一致性学习</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Widely used for unlabeled chest X-ray, fundus, and histopathology pretraining where same-disease negatives are prevalent.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">非对比 SSL 经典方法；增强策略与域内多样性对医学迁移至关重要</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Classic non-contrastive SSL framework; requires careful normalization and domain-valid augmentations.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">用同一图像跨视图预测学习增强不变性。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">目标网络由在线网络 EMA 更新并停止梯度，形成缓慢变化的自蒸馏靶。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">在线分支额外 predictor 造成结构不对称，无需显式负样本。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Train an online network (with an extra predictor head) to regress the stop-gradient representation of a momentum-updated target network.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Eliminates explicit negative pairs entirely while avoiding representation collapse via architectural asymmetry and EMA dynamics.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Asymmetric Cross-View Cosine Regression with EMA Target Network.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合将无标注医学影像转成可线性探测或少样本微调的表示。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">医学增强必须保持病灶与左右、灰度等语义，否则不变性目标会主动抹除临床信号。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Widely used for unlabeled chest X-ray, fundus, and histopathology pretraining where same-disease negatives are prevalent.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Classic non-contrastive SSL framework; requires careful normalization and domain-valid augmentations.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2020/hash/f3ada80d5c4ee70142b17b8192b2958e-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Bootstrap Your Own Latent: A New Approach to Self-Supervised Learning</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/google-deepmind/deepmind-research/tree/master/byol\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
